    {
      "id": "q_SFRHPFP9-Sn7-eJyQm-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 54.199989318847656,
      "y": 607.0000076293945,
      "width": 738.9999771118164,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ao",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1141433196,
      "version": 246,
      "versionNonce": 134753748,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "s19ehZFBUTiphU_CkbKMY",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1787859383201,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Content Extraction -  Structure content extraction \n2. Ingestion - Accept and normalize source text\n3. Document - Identify/classify document type\n4. Schema Context - Define/manage extraction schemas\n5. Validation Context - Validate LLM output against schema \n6. Prompt Context - Manage prompts/extraction instructions        \n7. Model Context - Manage LLM providers/models \n8. Job/Workflow Context - Coordinate extraction workflow \n9. Audit/Observability Context -Track requests, versions, failures, metrics ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Content Extraction -  Structure content extraction \n2. Ingestion - Accept and normalize source text\n3. Document - Identify/classify document type\n4. Schema Context - Define/manage extraction schemas\n5. Validation Context - Validate LLM output against schema \n6. Prompt Context - Manage prompts/extraction instructions        \n7. Model Context - Manage LLM providers/models \n8. Job/Workflow Context - Coordinate extraction workflow \n9. Audit/Observability Context -Track requests, versions, failures, metrics    ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
