      "seed": 1136209132,
      "version": 418,
      "versionNonce": 682735852,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787862941696,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Content Extraction -  Structure content extraction \n2. Ingestion/Document  - Accept and normalize source text/Identify/classify document type\n3. Schema Context - Define/manage extraction schemas\n4. Validation Context - Validate LLM output against schema \n5. Prompt Context - Manage prompts/extraction instructions        \n \n------Infra--------------------------------------------\nModel Context - Manage LLM providers/models \nAudit/Observability Context -Track requests, versions, failures, metrics \nApplication  Container - Job/Workflow Context - Coordinate extraction workflow \n ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Content Extraction -  Structure content extraction \n2. Ingestion/Document  - Accept and normalize source text/Identify/classify document type\n3. Schema Context - Define/manage extraction schemas\n4. Validation Context - Validate LLM output against schema \n5. Prompt Context - Manage prompts/extraction instructions        \n \n------Infra--------------------------------------------\nModel Context - Manage LLM providers/models \nAudit/Observability Context -Track requests, versions, failures, metrics \nApplication  Container - Job/Workflow Context - Coordinate extraction workflow \n ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
